        "description": "Documented ventricular arrhythmias or atrial fibrillation",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of echocardiographic evidence of dilated cardiomyopathy, conduction defect on ECG, and a pathogenic LMNA mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for confirmation; family screening recommended"
